      "name": "Mercy Vulnerability",
      "category": "defensive",
      "text": "Kalakaighs delight in the sight of fresh wounds, and when one is healed, they recoil in pain. When a creature heals from damage that the kalakaigh dealt on their last turn, the demon takes 4d6 mental damage. The kalakaigh can take this damage only once per round."
