    {
      "kind": "spell",
      "name": "Demonic Pact",
      "rank": 1,
      "ref": "spells:spell/demonic-pact"
    }
  ],
  "text": "A kalakaigh is above all else a killer—a fiendish incarnation of the sin of murder. They typically form from the souls of mortals who, in life, pursued murder as an obsession, killing simply for the thrill of killing.\nServants of Slaughter\nKalakaighs often serve the demon lords Shax and Zura, but some remain stubbornly devoted to Nocticula, a legacy from her time spent as a patron of assassins. These demons cling to the hope that Nocticula will return as their queen, if only they can murder enough innocents in her name."
